In this datasets file we have all the data preprocess for each approach.
Approach1:
fileStructure:
popularity,target_binary,popularity_minmax
6,0,0.06
23,0,0.23
0,0,0.0
57,1,0.57
99,1,0.99
For the first one the needed feature is only the populairty(cleaned and well preprocessed)
assuming that we will do a binary classification and we have no target collumn i created a 
binary one: if (popularity > 50) -> 1 (Hit)
            else (popularity <50) -> 0 (noHit)
Beside that, i created another collumn which is our main collumn(popularity) but normalizaed(minmax)
(values between 0 and 1).
Here, because our values are between 0 and 100 a minmax normalization is not really needed but 
i created it in case you want to use more normalized data.

