Same for the second, our only feature is popularity(cleaned and well preprocessed)
assuming that we will do a 4 class classification adn we have no target collumn i created
one based on this rule:((0-30)) - Niche -> mapped to 0
                       ((31-60)) - Average -> mapped to 1
                       ((61-80)) - Popular -> mapped to 2
                       ((81-100)) - Hit -> mapped to 3

Same thing happend with the normalization as in the first one.(you see filesStructure)

